<description>&lt;p&gt;The U.S. military is now assisting Ecuador in its first land operation against cartels, extending the conflict beyond urban centers to direct external involvement. At the same time, an attack on a fishing vessel off Ecuador’s coast resulted in multiple fatalities, showing violence spreading to the maritime domain. These actions expand the crisis geographically and involve foreign forces, unlike earlier phases focused on internal urban clashes. The only cited historical metric remains two battle‑related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNNzZNem85YTRaM2dFYW42RjRYXzZqOEpwR29fUmJRWW5Zd0kwbnZpbEhFb25ZTFFxUW4xYktwdTVFTmt1cElSMEJUXzl0WWpwOG5NV3Zia2ZHRk42UlFadUxicXFNcmMySU9IOTNVZHR0bW5sQTNtYzlKaTQ5OVJhTWZmMUhkaGJ6MjVJQU9lWFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOQk1GRDFXcmo5RGltNEt2QlJvcDBoOWdZUnpiNkExd3lvWlBweTdBaThuM0ZqZ2lUaldndk5SMFlIWTVyQWlaZThwT0NoV2pQcDJoV2QzMV80QnA0NmlmTldRMzFkSlQ1cjlzdGk4bzlXeXE1MTAxMWt6bEZaN2p0aWE4cm1qQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chosunbiz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPS0FEVERUTVcwVFd4NUNKX2dRRzNzQXhfQUlNX2JDRW9zeWsyeU93ZVl5XzJ1a3BJbUtZQ1N2SjVPLTVlN0pfZUw4OFVWRWptM2VuNVYtSV9wbm5ELW5hdEtZdWNDclZwLTFFSmlLeUNrY3RnVk9KdkJfNFdkbmxZS0lMVXdpZWVROE9ob3VQY0E2UDJyVjhoekRlN3ljWHVseVNCNklFLUlVYm_SAbABQVVfeXFMUEVoWXJOeGhaM1FGMWZfUFRyOXRYVnJBTUFWV3FBT1U0YTVDdF9iR3g0NGhxWjVLOHhBTVhqYUNWemVNSms2U3ItX21fUVJKZUg4S2U5SVBSMzg3TGVLa0RwY3lqWUR2WjdZSUVELXJETElPNmctMkVva3hWTURMa3QzU1ZIcGx1dU5tWDlRT3Z2bjVVMUJmNzVnSFA1c1BQNHVCUGUzLUxCUnV1azI4Rzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Vide